Doesn't do anything on my system.  Amusing to think that it would,
however.  But there's an easier (or at least less obscure) way to get
the amulet if "cheating" is what turns you on.

1.  Start the game with "nethack -u wizard -D"

2.  Press ^W and wish for the amulet.

3.  While you're at it, wish for all the stuff you'll need to defeat the
baddies in the end game.

'Course, you won't get on the high score list if you do this, but at
least it, unlike the gibberish above, actually does work.  :-)

